:''For the enemy encountered in the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]], see [[Beastly Nero (Enemy)]].''
'''Fiendish Nero''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 13.6 Update|Version 13.6]] increases range and health.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 472
|rarity = SR
|name1 = Fiendish Nero
|name2 = Beastly Nero
|name3 = Huge Nero
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Beastly Nero''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Huge Nero''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
Fiendish Nero is essentially an anti-Zombie [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]], as it has a very high 14k DPS against Zombies with all [[Fruit Treasures]]. Its massive negative Omni Strike range also helps it attack Zombies that unburrow or revive behind it. Like most anti-Zombie units, its main problem is poor range, as it has problems reaching enemies like [[Cadaver Bear]] and [[Zamelle]].

==='''True Form'''===
Fiendish Nero's True Form increases its range and health. It's nothing major, but having more stats helps it work even better against Zombies, especially against [[Lord Gravey]], whom it now outranges.

{{Job|Classification = Melee & Nuker|TrueClass = Midranger & Nuker|UltraClass=}}

